# A deployment's accepted runner profile names its host, its account home and
# absolute controller paths. It is emitted per host, held in private custody and
# anchored by digest -- it is not a public product artifact. The synthetic
# example (RUNNER-PROFILE.example.json) is the public shape.
RUNNER-PROFILE.*.json
!RUNNER-PROFILE.example.json

# Derived at qualification time from the accepted profile.
RUNNER-PROFILE.qualification.json

__pycache__/
